---
name: CareerOS frontend skills
description: Load CareerOS frontend skills when editing the copilot UI, frontend tests, or frontend build scripts.
globs:
  - frontend/**/*.ts
  - frontend/**/*.tsx
  - frontend/**/*.css
  - frontend/**/*.mjs
  - frontend/**/*.html
  - tests/test_frontend_source.py
alwaysApply: false
---

When editing CareerOS frontend, read the matching skill under `.cursor/skills/` before coding:

- `careeros-frontend-contract` — API, JWT, score labels, forbidden copy (always)
- `careeros-design-system` — components, tokens, layout, CSS
- `frontend-a11y` — forms, tables, charts, dialogs, banners
- `frontend-test` — Vitest / Testing Library / Playwright (not the pytest test-writer)
- `careeros-honest-analytics` — dashboards, charts, KPIs, insights
- `careeros-figma` — Figma library, design, or design-to-code
- `careeros-telemetry` — tracking SDKs, PostHog/Mixpanel/GA, outcome tracking

Do not patch `frontend/dist`. Do not add hosted LLM clients. Do not show hiring probability.
